('Exotic Kashmir with Gulmarg – Durga Puja Special', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered</h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar (1 night)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pahalgam (2 nights)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gulmarg (1 night)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar (2 nights)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Economy airfare – Ex Hub</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Accommodation on twin sharing basis in hotels mentioned or similar.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meal (06 Breakfast &amp; 06 Dinner)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Extra Toppings: – Snacks with Coffee / Tea / Cold Drink (Once during the Day)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar Houseboat Stay</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shikara Ride at Dal Lake</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mughal Gardens – Shalimar Bagh &amp; Nishat Bagh.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tulip Gardens during the bloom time.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Avantipur Ruins &amp; Martand Sun Temple</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Aru Valley, Betaab Valley &amp; Chandanwari.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kashmiri Cricket Bat Factory</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola Ride at Gulmarg (Phase 1)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">500 ml Water Bottles Per Day</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional Tour Manager [Subject to Min. 15 Pax Travelling]</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (upto the age of 69yrs)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transfers &amp; sightseeing by AC vehicles (except for the hilly drives)<br></span><strong>Transfers &amp; sightseeing by AC vehicles&nbsp; (except for the hilly drives)</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vehicles as per group size on Sharing basis (6 Pax in Innova; 10 in Tempo Traveller; Vehicle Type Cannot be confirmed at the </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">time of Booking)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vehicle is not at disposal – means it is for transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seats Allotment in the Vehicle is on first come first serve basis at the venue, irrespective of the booking dates.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Additional / personal use of vehicle.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of lunches</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any personal expenses, room service &amp; special orders, mineral water, alcoholic &amp; non alcoholic beverages, porterage, tips, phone calls,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">laundry etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any extra excursions or sightseeing apart from the above specified itinerary.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Camera fees</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any incidental and other expenses which are not specified in the inclusions.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST will be applicable as per prevailing rates&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Itinerary&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<h4>Day 1 – Arrival in Srinagar&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner, snacks and beverages included&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Day 2 – Srinagar to Pahalgam visit&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Day 3 – Pahalgam excursion&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Half Day excursion to Aru Valley, Betaab Valley, Chandanwari&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Day 4 – Pahalgam to Gulmarg&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Day 5 – Sonmarg to Srinagar&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Day 6 – Excursion to Gulmarg&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gulmarg excursion&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Day 7 – Departure from Srinagar&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flight transfers&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 8, 'exotic-kashmir-with-gulmarg-durga-puja-special'),
