('Customizable Kashmir-Wow Kashmir With Gulmarg And Sonmarg Excursion', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered</h3>\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar arrival at 12 in the noon (1 night)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pahalgam (2 nights)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Back to Srinagar (3 nights)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Breakfast</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">05 Complimentary Dinner</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Hi-Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri lunch on the lake.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri Dinner</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shikara ride on Dal Lake</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola ride (Phase – 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh<br></span><strong>(Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The above Price doesn’t include:</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in the price included.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in the itinerary.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, and guide charges.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>Itinerary&nbsp;</b></h4>\r\n<h5>Day 1 – Srinagar Houseboats<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon activity – At leisure.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Day 2 – Pahalgam</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning activity – At leisure.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Day 3 – Pahalgam<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity – (Start Time: 08:30 | Duration: 07:00 hrs)<br></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pahalgam Local City Tour&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Aru Valley, Chandanwari, Betab Valley&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Day 4 – Check-in to Srinagar hotel</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning activity – At leisure.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Day 5 – Srinagar</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity – (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 05:00 hrs)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Excursion Gulmarg.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Day 6 – Srinagar</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity – (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 05:00 hrs)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Excursion Sonmarg.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy the beauty of snow-capped peaks and glaciers.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity – At leisure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Day 7 – <b>Srinagar </b></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Airport transfers</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 15, 'customizable-kashmir-wow-kashmir-with-gulmarg-and-sonmarg-excursion'),
('Manmohak Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered</h3>\r\n<h4>London</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd Level Of Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit The Louvre</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Mini Europe</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour Of Brussels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit The Cologne Cathedral</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy Rhine River Cruise</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Of Heidelberg&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>02 nights in <strong>London (LHR Area), United Kingdom</strong> at Hotel Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France</strong> at Hotel Moxy CDG / B&amp;B CDG or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in <strong>Belgium</strong> at Hotel Ramada Brussels Woulwe / Best Western Brussels South or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in <strong>Germany</strong> at Hotel NH Frankfurt West&nbsp; / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>03 nights in <strong>Switzerland </strong>at Hotel Ibis Zurich Messe Airport /BB Oftringen / HI Express Neuenkirch or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Continental Breakfast includes Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>08 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Lunches.</li>\r\n<li>09 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners.<br><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</em></strong>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tips are expected for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa and passport requirements</h4>\r\n<h5><strong>Medical Insurance</strong></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Normal insurance charges for the duration of this tour are included here with their proper ranges of price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and passengers who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges as per their extension plans.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Visa Requirements</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry with Schengen &amp; UK visa.</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes the documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5>Passport</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passport is estimated to be valid for 6 months from the date of our departure for the tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 16, 'manmohak-europe-summer-2024'),
('Ananya Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Louvre Museum with Guide&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Disneyland ® Paris</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Brussels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</li>\r\n<li>Visit Madurodam (From 13th May)</li>\r\n<li>Visit a cheese farm and a wooden shoe workshop</li>\r\n<li>Visit Dam Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>View the Rhine Falls&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>03 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG area), France</strong> at Hotel Moxy CDG or similar places.</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in <strong>Belgium / Netherlands</strong> at Hotel NH Koningshof or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>01 night in <strong>Rhineland, Germany</strong> at NH Frankfurt West or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>03 nights in <strong>Central Switzerland</strong> at Hotel Ibis Zurich / BB Oftringen / HI Express Neuenkirch or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Continental Breakfast includes Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee.</li>\r\n<li>07 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian lunches.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>09 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners.<br><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</em></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tips are expected for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 17, 'ananya-europe-summer-2024'),
