ntire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips are expected for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp; </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 18, 'snighdo-sarathe-europe-durga-puja-special'),
('Fantastic France', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>Sightseeing</h4>\r\n<h4><b><i>(Tour starts from a city centre point, transportation to and from the hotel is not included)&nbsp;</i></b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Interactive Paris City Tour, Seine Cruise, and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (Approx. 4 Hrs)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private walking tour of Bordeaux</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">La Cité Du Vin Wine Culture Museum (Entrance Ticket)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trip To Carcassonne Cite Medievale And Comtale Castle Tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marseille City Tour (Private Walking Tour)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3 Nights accommodation in Paris that is based on the hotel category selected or similar.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 Nights accommodation in Bordeaux that is based on the hotel category selected or similar.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 Nights accommodation in Toulouse that is based on the hotel category selected or similar</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 Nights accommodation in Marseille that is based on the hotel category selected or similar&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Breakfast (Except Day 1)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<h4><b>Transfers: (Includes the limited waiting hours with Point to Point Transfer)</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arrival transfer from Paris Railway Station / Paris Airport to the chosen Hotel on Private Basis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Departure Transfer from Marseille Hotel to Marseille Airport / Railway Station</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br></span>Railway Ticket (Costing of these Train tickets are subject to vary until booked)</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2nd Class Railway Ticket from Paris to Bordeaux</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2nd Class Railway Ticket from Bordeaux to Toulouse</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2nd Class Railway Ticket from Toulouse to Marseille&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Insurance</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance for Overseas journeys (up to 60 years age group only)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">International air ticket and Domestic ticket if any, along with Airport taxes and Visa charges.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">TCS and GST are not included in the above identified cost and will be charged on the final amount.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than those that are specified (if any).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Laundry, telephone, optional excursions, and other items of a personal nature.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 5 per person per day is not included in the price.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of PCR Test is not included and any medical examination will be treated as actual.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any items or services not specified in the tour guide ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 19, 'fantastic-france'),
('Magical Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>United Kingdom</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour of London</li>\r\n<li>Entrance to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</li>\r\n<li>Ride on the London Eye&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>France</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour of Paris</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower</li>\r\n<li>Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</li>\r\n<li>Illumination Tour of Paris&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Seine river cruise</li>\r\n<li>Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Glacier 3000&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Ride on the Scenic Golden Pass Train</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Geneva</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Gstaad</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Montreux</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Lucerne</li>\r\n<li>Cruise on Lake Lucerne</li>\r\n<li>Visit Lindt Home of Chocolate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>02 nights in <strong>London (Heathrow Area), United Kingdom</strong> at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott LHR / Radisson LHR / Crown Plaza LHR or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>03 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France </strong>at Hotel Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Nights in <strong>Leysin / Sion / Lausanne, Switzerland</strong> at Hotel Alpine Classic / Moxy or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Nights in <strong>Zurich, Switzerland</strong> at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Continental Breakfast includes Bread with Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>04 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Lunches.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>09 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners. <br><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</em></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 20, 'magical-europe-summer-2024'),
('Super Budget Tour Of Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>London</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ride on the London Eye</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mini Europe</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Brussels</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne Cathedral</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Rhine River Cruise&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Heidelberg</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Black Forest&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">View the Rhine Falls</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Lucerne</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in </span><b>London (LHR Area), United Kingdom</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Holiday Inn express or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in </span><b>Paris (CDG Area), France</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Moxy CDG / B&amp;B CDG or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Belgium</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Ramada Brussels Woulwe / Best Western Brussels South or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Germany</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel NH Frankfurt West&nbsp; / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in </span><b>Switzerland</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Ibis Zurich Messe Airport /BB Oftringen / HI Express Neuenkirch or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Continental Breakfast (Breakfast includes Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">09 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 21, 'super-budget-tour-of-europe-summer-2024');
INSERT INTO `tourinfo` (`title`, `htmlDescription`, `ID`, `URL`) VALUES
('Darsaniya Europe With Louvre – Durga Puja Special', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">River Seine Cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Louvre Museum</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Montmartre&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Illumination Tour of Paris</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Lucerne</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Piazzale Michelangelo</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Field of Miracles – Photo stop at the Leaning Tower of Pisa</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Venice</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and shop</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights at Zenitude CDG / Moxy CDG / Ibis Styles CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights at Novotel Zurich Messe / Prizeotel Affoltern am Albis or similar in Switzerland.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Coronado / Serpiano or similar in Mendriso / Serpiano, Switzerland.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights at Hotel Park / President / Fortuna or similar in Arezzo / Chianciano Terme, Italy.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel AC / SHG Catullo Verona / Alfa Fiera or similar in Vicenza, Italy.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel Hampton by Hilton / Holiday Inn Express or similar in Munich, Germany.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">9 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian lunches.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10 Indian Jain / vegetarian /non-vegetarian dinners.<br></span><b><i>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</i></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips are expected for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 22, 'darsaniya-europe-with-louvre-durga-puja-special'),
