00;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Peter’s Basilica And Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s Square On A Private Boat</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour Of Venice&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour Of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit The Swarovski Crystal Museum And Shop</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in </span><b>Paris (CDG Area), France,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Zenitude CDG / Moxy CDG / Ibis Styles CDG or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in </span><b>Switzerland,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Novotel Zurich Messe / Prizeotel Affoltern am Albis or similar places.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Mendriso / Serpiano, Switzerland,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Coronado / Serpiano or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in </span><b>Arezzo / Chianciano Terme, Italy</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Park / President / Fortuna or similar places.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Vicenza, Italy</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel AC / SHG Catullo Verona / Alfa Fiera or similar places.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Munich, Germany</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Hampton by Hilton / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">9 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian lunches.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10 Indian Jain / vegetarian /non-vegetarian dinners.<br></span><b><i>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</i></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips are expected for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 24, 'darsaniya-europe-summer-2024'),
('Fusion Europe (Winter)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered</h3>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower</li>\r\n<li>Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy Illumination Tour on River Seine Cruise</li>\r\n<li>Visit Disneyland ® Paris</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Mt. Titlis</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Lucerne</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Como</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Photo Stop at Lake Como</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Square of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Venice</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li>\r\n<li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal museum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>3 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France,</strong> at Ibis style CDG / Mercure CDG / Zenitude CDG or similar places.</li>\r\n<li>2 nights in <strong>Switzerland,</strong> at Novotel Zurich Messe / Holiday Inn Express Zurich Messe or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>1 night in <strong>Mendriso / Serpiano, Switzerland,</strong> at Coronado / Serpiano or similar places.</li>\r\n<li>2 nights in <strong>Arezzo / Castiglion, Italy,</strong> at Hotel Park / President or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>1 night in <strong>Vicenza, Italy,</strong> at Hotel AC / Alpha Fiera or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>1 night in <strong>Munich, Germany</strong> at Hotel Hampton by Hilton / Holiday Inn Express or similar places.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Note:</strong> Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</li>\r\n<li>05 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian lunches.</li>\r\n<li>10 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian dinners.</li>\r\n<li>Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.</li>\r\n<li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.</li>\r\n<li>No porterage will be included.</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.</li>\r\n<li>Safety Regulations for Arrival and Departure PCR – COVID test only if required by the chosen airline or the Government bodies.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa and Passport requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Passport</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passport is estimated to be valid for 6 months from the date of our departure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 25, 'fusion-europe-winter'),
('European Fusion Dreams – Senior Citizens Special (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered</h3>\r\n<h4>France</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Louvre Museum</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seine river cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Tour of Versailles Palace</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mount Titlis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Lucerne</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>Austria</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s Square on a Private Boat in Venice</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Venice</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Walking tour of Florence&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour of Rome&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Peter’s Basilica &amp; Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in </span><b>Paris (CDG Area), France,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in </span><b>Switzerland,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Novotel Zurich Messe / Prizeotel Affoltern am Albis or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Seefeld / Innsbruck, Austria,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Alpenkoning or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in </span><b>Padova / Ferrara, Italy,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Blue Dream or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in </span><b>Arezzo, Italy,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at Hotel Park or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">09 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian lunches.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10 Indian Jain / vegetarian /non-vegetarian dinners.<br></span><b><i>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</i></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips are expected for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 26, 'european-fusion-dreams-senior-citizens-special-summer-2024'),
('Fusion Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower</li>\r\n<li>Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy Illumination Tour of Paris</li>\r\n<li>Seine River Cruise</li>\r\n<li>Visit Disneyland® Paris·(01 Day 01 Park)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Lucerne&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy- Como</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Photo Stop at Lake Como</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Venice</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li>\r\n<li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>03 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France,</strong> at Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in <strong>Switzerland,</strong> at Novotel Zurich Messe / Prizeotel Affoltern am Albis or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in <strong>Mendriso / Serpiano, Switzerland,</strong> at Coronado / Serpiano or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in <strong>Castiglione / Chianciano Terme, Italy,</strong> at Hotel Park /&nbsp; Fortuna or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in<strong> Vicenza / Verona, Italy,</strong> at Hotel AC by Marriott / Alfa Fiera / SHG Catullo or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in <strong>Munich, Germany,</strong> at Hotel Hampton by Hilton / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.</li>\r\n<li>05 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian lunches.</li>\r\n<li>10 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian dinners.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</em></strong></p>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All local taxes and services as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the above-mentioned itinerary.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to minimum 15 customers).&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before the published departure date as mentioned in the brochure or like to come back on a later date after the tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff / travel agent. Kindly note, the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days prior to departure date.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing your service e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff etc. It is mandatory to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 11 Days, the total Tips amount is EUR 33 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 250,000.</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as on 1st September 2023)</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes as applicable are extra.</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.</li>\r\n<li>No porterage included.</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menu provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your itinerary.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in your itinerary.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers, Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry Schengen visa.</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes documentation, processing and consulate fees.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Passport</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passport should be valid for 6 months from the date of our departure.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 27, 'fusion-europe-summer-2024');
