\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 28, 'european-dreams-senior-citizen-special-summer-2024'),
('Highlights of Europe (DISNEYLAND®) (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered</h3>\r\n<h4>London</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrance to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ride on the London Eye</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Brussels&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Atomium</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Madurodam (From 13th May)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit a Cheese Farm and a Wooden Shoe Workshop&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Dam Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne Cathedral</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy River Rhine Cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Black Forest</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Rhine Falls&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Lucerne</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>ITALY</h4>\r\n<h4>Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s Square on a Private Boat</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Venice</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Walking Tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>Vatican City</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Peter’s Basilica &amp; Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights at Hotel Holiday Inn Express T4 / Ibis LHR or similar in London (Heathrow Area), United Kingdom.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights at Hotel Ibis / B&amp;B / Moxy CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights at NH / Best Western or similar in Belgium / Netherlands</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel NH Frankfurt or similar in Germany</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights at Hotel Ibis Zurich /BB Oftringen / HI Express Neuenkirch or similar in Switzerland</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel Alpenkoning or similar in Seefeld / Innsbruck, Austria</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel Blue Dream or similar in Padova / Ferrara, Italy</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel BB Pomezia or similar in Rome, Italy</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night at Hotel Park or similar in Arezzo, Italy&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental buffet breakfast that include bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs and cut fruits.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">06 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian lunches.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 Indian Jain /vegetarian / non–vegetarian dinners.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b><i>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</i></b></p>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 29, 'highlights-of-europe-disneyland-summer-2024'),
('Enchanting East Europe With 4 Nights Balkans (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations Covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>Germany – Berlin</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Entrance to Topography of Terror Museum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Dresden</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Czech Republic – Prague</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n<li>Entrance to the Prague Castle&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit St. Vitus Cathedral&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Golden Lane</li>\r\n<li>Historic Tram Experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Poland – Krakow</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Horse Carriage ride</li>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour</li>\r\n<li>Visit Wieliczka Salt mines</li>\r\n<li>Auschwitz concentration camp</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria – Vienna</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n<li>Visit Schonbrunn Palace</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Salzburg &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided walking tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Hungary – Visegrad</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Visegrad castle</li>\r\n<li>See the Knight Tournament</li>\r\n<li>Visit Palinka factory</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Budapest</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n<li>Hungarian Horsemanship show</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy the Danube river cruise&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Croatia</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour of Zagreb</li>\r\n<li>Visit Plitvice lake national park&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Slovenia</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Postojna Caves</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Ljubljana</li>\r\n<li>Boat ride in lake Bled&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>02 nights in Berlin, Germany, at Courtyard by Marriott Berlin City Centre / Holiday Inn City West or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Prague, Czech Republic, at International Royal Prague / Courtyard by Marriott Prague airport / Clarion Congress or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Krakow, Poland, at Q+ Krakow / Novotel / Swing or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Vienna, Austria, at Austria Trend / Event Hotel Pyramide / Holiday Inn or similar places.</li>\r\n<li>03 nights in Budapest, Hungary, at Park Inn / Novotel / Danubius or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Zagreb, Croatia, at Grand Hotel / Novotel or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Ljubljana. Slovenia, at Four Points / Radisson Blu / B&amp;B / Holiday Inn Express similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 Night in Salzburg, Austria, at Austria Trend / Mercure or similar places.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Continental buffet breakfasts that include bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, tea, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits.</li>\r\n<li>07 Indian Jain / vegetarian/ non-vegetarian lunches.</li>\r\n<li>14 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian dinners. <br><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 30, 'enchanting-east-europe-with-4-nights-balkans-summer-2024'),
('Chitramoy Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata.&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>London</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Tower of London – see the famous Kohinoor Diamond&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Madame Tussauds</li>\r\n<li>Ride on the London Eye</li>\r\n<li>London to Paris by Eurostar&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Guided Tour of Versailles Palace</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Seine River Cruise&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Mini Europe</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Brussels&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Photo stop at Atomium&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May, 2024)</li>\r\n<li>Visit Volendam (From 13th May, 2024)</li>\r\n<li>Visit a Cheese Farm and a Wooden Shoe Workshop&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy Amsterdam Canal Cruise</li>\r\n<li>Visit Dam Square&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Cologne Cathedral</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy River Rhine Cruise</li>\r\n<li>Visit Black Forest&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>View the Rhine Falls&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Mt. Titlis</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Lucerne&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Leichtenstein</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Enjoy a Mini Train Ride&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy- Venice&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit St. Mark’s Square on a Private Boat</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Venice</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided Walking Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>02 nights in London (LHR Area), United Kingdom, at Hotel Holiday Inn Express LHR / Delta or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Paris (CDG Area), France, at Hotel B&amp;B CDG / Hotel Inn / Ibis Styles CDG or similar places.</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at NH Koningshof or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Germany, at Hotel NH Frankfurt West / NH Mannheim Viernheim or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>03 nights in Engelberg, Switzerland, at Hotel Novotel / Prizeotel or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Seefeld / Innsbruck, Austria, at Hotel Alpenkoning or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Rovigo, Italy, at Hotel Blue Dream or similar places.</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Arezzo / Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Park or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily continental buffet breakfast including bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>13 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian lunches.</li>\r\n<li>14 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian dinners. <br><em><strong>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain – vegetarian.</strong></em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 31, 'chitramoy-europe-summer-2024'),
('Chitramoy Europe – Durga Puja Special', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure City: Kolkata&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>London</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Tower of London – see the famous Kohinoor Diamond</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Madame Tussauds</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ride on the London Eye</span></li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"2\">London to Paris by Eurostar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour Guided&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tour of Versailles Palace</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seine River Cruise</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mini Europe</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Brussels&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Atomium</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Volendam&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit a Cheese Farm and a Wooden Shoe Workshop&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Amsterdam Canal Cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Dam Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne CathedralEnjoy River Rhine CruiseVisit Black Forest</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">View the Rhine Falls&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Lucerne</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Liechtenstein</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy a Mini Train Ride</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s Square on a Private Boat Orientation tour of Venice&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Walking Tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in London (LHR Area), United Kingdom, at Hotel Holiday Inn Express LHR / Delta or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Paris (CDG Area), France, at Hotel B&amp;B CDG / Hotel Inn / Ibis Styles CDG or similar places.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at NH Koningshof or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Germany, at Hotel NH Frankfurt West / NH Mannheim Viernheim or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in Engelberg, Switzerland, at Hotel Novotel / Prizeotel or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Seefeld / Innsbruck, Austria, at Hotel Alpenkoning or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Rovigo, Italy, at Hotel Blue Dream or similar places.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Arezzo / Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Park or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental buffet breakfast including bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">13 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian lunches.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian dinners. <br></span><em><strong>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain – vegetarian.</strong></em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 32, 'chitramoy-europe-durga-puja-special');
INSERT INTO `tourinfo` (`title`, `htmlDescription`, `ID`, `URL`) VALUES
('Grand Bargain Tour Of Europe With Versailles And Montmartre (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city : Kolkata&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4><b>London</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ride on the London Eye</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>Paris</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided tour of Versailles Palace</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Montmartre</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Illumination Tour of Paris</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mini Europe&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Brussels&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Amsterdam canal cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Volendam (From 13th May)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit a cheese farm and a wooden shoe workshop (From 13th May)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne Cathedral</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy River Rhine cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Black Forest</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">View the Rhine Falls</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Lucerne&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and shop</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided walking tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Vatican Museum and Sistine Chapel</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in London, United Kingdom, at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott LHR / Crown Plaza LHR / Radisson LHR or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Paris, France, at Hotel Millenium CDG / Novotel Orly / Mercure CDG or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at Hotel Holiday Inn / Van der Valk/ NH or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Germany, at Hotel Intercity Frankfurt / Best Western Frankfurt or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in Switzerland, at Hotel Central / Terrace or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Innsbruck / Seefeld, Austria, at Hotel Alp / Alpenkoning or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Ferrara / Padova, Italy, at Hotel Astra / AC by Marriott Padova or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Grand Fonti/ Excelsior/ Fortuna or similar lodging.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental buffet breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">08 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian lunches.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 Indian Jain – vegetarian – non-vegetarian dinners.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Local Lunch.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Note: Packed lunches, only if applicable, will be Jain – vegetarian. <br></span><b>L: Lunch | D: Dinner | PL: Packed Lunch | PD: Packed Dinner | LL: Local Lunch | LD: Local Dinner&nbsp;</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp; </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 33, 'grand-bargain-tour-of-europe-with-versailles-and-montmartre-summer-2024'),
('Grand Bargain Tour Of Europe With Disneyland (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>London</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n<li>Visit to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</li>\r\n<li>Ride on the London Eye</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy the Illumination Tour of Paris</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Mini Europe&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Brussels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Enjoy the Amsterdam Canal cruise</li>\r\n<li>Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</li>\r\n<li>Visit Volendam (From 13th May)</li>\r\n<li>Visit a cheese farm and a wooden shoe workshop (From 13th May)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Cologne Cathedral</li>\r\n<li>Enjoy the River Rhine cruise&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit the Black Forest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>View the Rhine Falls</li>\r\n<li>Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Lucerne</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and shop</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit St. Mark’s Square on a private boat</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided Walking Tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided city tour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Vatican Museum and Sistine Chapel.</li>\r\n<li>Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Mediterranean Cruise</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Marseille, France.</li>\r\n<li>Visit Barcelona, Spain.</li>\r\n<li>All included On-board amenities such as International Shows, Live Music, and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>02 nights in London, United Kingdom, at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott LHR / Crown Plaza LHR / Radisson LHR or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Paris, France, at Hotel Millennium Hotel Paris CDG / Novotel Orly / Mercure CDG or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at Hotel Holiday Inn / Van der Valk / NH Konningshof or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Germany, at Hotel Intercity Frankfurt / Best Western Frankfurt or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>03 nights in Switzerland, at Hotel Central / Terrace or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Innsbruck / Seefeld, Austria, at Hotel Alp / Alpenkoning or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 night in Ferrara / Padova, Italy, at Hotel Astra / AC by Marriott Padova or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 nights in Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Grand Fonti/ Excelsior/ Fortuna or similar lodging.</li>\r\n<li>04 nights on a Costa Cruise in an Inside cabin.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily continental buffet breakfast including bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>08 Indian Jain / vegetarian / nonvegetarian lunches.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 Local Lunch.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>14 Indian Jain /vegetarian / non-vegetarian dinners.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Meals on board as per the Cruise Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>Mandatory Gratuities on the Cruise of EURO 11 per person per night. For the entire duration of this specific cruise, which is 4 nights, the total Gratuities amount is estimated to be EUR 44 per person which is to be paid at the exact time of boarding our cruise.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 34, 'grand-bargain-tour-of-europe-with-disneyland-summer-2024'),
('Best Of East and West Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city: Kolkata&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h4>France</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)</li>\r\n<li>Visit Louvre Museum</li>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour of Paris</li>\r\n<li>Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower</li>\r\n<li>Illumination Tour of Paris</li>\r\n<li>Seine river cruise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Geneva</li>\r\n<li>Visit Glacier 3000&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Saanen &amp; Gstaad</li>\r\n<li>Ride on the Scenic Golden Pass Train</li>\r\n<li>Visit Maison Cailler – Chocolate Factory</li>\r\n<li>Visit Harder Kulm in Interlaken&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Orientation Tour of Lucerne</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum</li>\r\n<li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li>\r\n<li>Visit Hallein Salt Mines</li>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour of Salzburg</li>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour of Vienna</li>\r\n<li>Visit Schonbrunn Palace</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Czech Republic</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Guided Tour of Cesky Krumlov</li>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour of Prague</li>\r\n<li>Visit Prague Castle&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Visit St. Vitus Cathedral&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Golden Lane&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Slovakia</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mini Train Ride in Bratislava&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Hungary</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Enjoy Danube River Cruise</li>\r\n<li>Guided City Tour of Budapest</li>\r\n<li>Hungarian Horsemanship show</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>03 nights in France, Paris (CDG Area), at Hotel Zenitude / Moxy CDG or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Nights in Switzerland, Villars / Leysin, at Hotel Eurotel Victoria / Alpine Classic or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Nights in Zurich, Switzerland, at Hotel Novotel / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 Night in Innsbruck / Seefeld, Austria, at Hotel Alp / Alpenkoning or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 Night in Salzburg, Austria, at Hotel Austria Trend or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Nights in Prague, Czech Republic, at Hotel Barcelo / Royal Prague or similar places.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Nights in Budapest, Hungary, at Hotel Holiday Inn or similar lodging.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>01 Night in Vienna, Austria, at Hotel Austria Trend or similar lodging.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily Continental Breakfast that includes Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>07 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Lunches.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>02 Local Lunches.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>14 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners.<br><strong><em>Note:</em></strong><strong><em> Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</em></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned above of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li>\r\n<li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li>\r\n<li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li>\r\n<li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li>\r\n<li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa and passport requirements&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schengen Visa for Multiple entry.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>This cost includes the entire documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>PASSPORT</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The passport is required to be valid for a minimal duration of 6 months from our departure date.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 35, 'best-of-east-and-west-europe-summer-2024'),
('Sensational Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city : Kolkata<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered</h3>\r\n<h4>France</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour of Paris</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Fragonard Museum</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Illumination tour of Paris</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seine river cruise</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Brussels</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo Stop at Atomium&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dam Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Madurodam – Holland in Miniature (From 13th May 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit a Cheese Farm &amp; Wooden shoe factory</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy the River Rhine cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne Cathedral</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Black Forest</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Rhine Falls</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Lucerne</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Diavolezza via train and cable car in St Moritz</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Horse carriage ride in St Moritz</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and shop</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s Square on a private boat</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Walking Tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Vatican Museum and Sistine Chapel</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Square of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in Paris, France, at the Hotel Mercure CDG / Novotel CDG /Zenitude or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at Hotel NH / Best Western or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Germany, at Hotel NH / Mercure / Holiday Inn&nbsp; / Intercity or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Switzerland, at Hotel Novotel / Radisson Zurich or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in St.Moritz, Switzerland, at Hotel Rhine Victoria / Laudinella or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Innsbruck / Seefeld, Austria, at Hotel Alpenkoning / Seelos or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Ferrara / Padova, Italy, at Hotel Best Western / Astra / Unaway or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Grand Fonti/ Excelsior/ Fortuna or similar lodging.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental breakfast that includes bread with butter, jam, cereals, juice, milk, and coffee for travelers.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">09 Indian Jain / vegetarian/non-vegetarian lunches.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Local Lunch.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian dinners.&nbsp;<br></span><strong><i>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</i></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa and passport requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry Schengen visa.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes the entire documentation, processing, and consulate fees.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>PASSPORT</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The passport is required to be valid for a minimal duration of 6 months from our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 36, 'sensational-europe-summer-2024'),
('Highlights of Europe (Summer 2024)', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align matt\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41px ;\"><div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\" style=\"text-transform: none ;\"><h2>Departure city : Kolkata</h2>\r\n<h3>Destinations covered</h3>\r\n<h4>United Kingdom</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrance to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ride on the London Eye</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paris</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Tour of Versailles Palace</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Illumination Tour of Paris with Seine River Cruise (Optional)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Belgium <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Brussels&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Atomium&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Netherlands</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Madurodam (From 13th May)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit a Cheese Farm and a Wooden Shoe Workshop&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Dam Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Germany</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne Cathedral&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy the River Rhine Cruise</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Black Forest&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Switzerland</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photo stop at Rhine Falls&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Lucerne&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chance to Visit Jungfraujoch with lunch &amp; Interlaken (Optional)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Austria</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Italy – Venice</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s Square on a Private Boat</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Venice</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Florence</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided Walking Tour&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Rome</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided City Tour&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Vatican City</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Peter’s Basilica &amp; Square</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Pisa</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Accommodation<b></b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in London, at Hotel Holiday Inn Express, Ibis LHR, or similar places in the Heathrow Area, United Kingdom.</span></li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in France, at Hotel Ibis / B&amp;B / Moxy CDG or similar places in Paris (CDG Area).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, lodging at NH / Best Western or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Germany, at Hotel NH Frankfurt or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in Switzerland, at Hotel Ibis Zurich /BB Oftringen / HI Express Neuenkirch or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Seefeld / Innsbruck, Austria, at Hotel Alpenkoning or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Padova / Ferrara, Italy, at Hotel Blue Dream or similar places.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Arezzo, Italy, at Hotel Park or similar places. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Meals</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Breakfast to be a Continental Buffet including Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Fruit Juice, Milk, Coffee, Hot Eggs &amp; Cut Fruits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">07 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non–Vegetarian lunches</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non–Vegetarian dinners</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">L: Lunch | D: Dinner | PL: Packed lunch | PD: Packed Dinner | LL: Local Lunch | LD: Local Dinner<br></span><strong><i>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian</i></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return with economy class group airfare according to our tour guidelines.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All local taxes and services need to be provided as of 1st September 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa with Medical Insurance is essential for the entire duration of this tour.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation according to the tour guidelines.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers along with extensive excursions and entrance fees (depicted by our tour plan) by the services of a deluxe air-conditioned coach.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative will be provided. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers, and Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Visa requirements</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div></div>', 37, 'highlights-of-europe-summer-2024');
